{"readiness":{"revision":"1d0debcf6ea692ecb7d804e260fa10a373bbf8b438ea65975a659f9525057407","state":"unknown","slices":[{"scope":"01-create-redirect","id":"01-create-redirect","readiness":{"configured":true,"revision":"228a30ec7752ed1baecb522e9d2f99a6b71cc78211e7c192d6bd99cc3bd82d6d","state":"not-ready","history":[],"items":[{"id":"item-ef19e6f933b9f07dfdf4","text":"AC-1 through AC-28 are each covered by a named functional test in `src/functionalTest/java` (tabled criteria as one parameterised test each), and all are green on the candidate SHA with `scripts/gw check`.","index":1,"source":{"file":"SPEC.md","line":374},"revision":"9387dd6bc1728420537c28a478211534344c9b1ac2cedfa8e96e127fe39e74aa","state":"pending","reason":"No current attributed judgment","judgment":null},{"id":"item-c7bc87bb634edb9adc12","text":"`scripts/gw check` reports 100 % line and 100 % branch coverage on the merged unit and functional execution data for the candidate SHA (NFR-M1).","index":2,"source":{"file":"SPEC.md","line":375},"revision":"9fd84acdcad6543c099e6a00d26475c66f6769b83c0d44514814ef9b0644992f","state":"pending","reason":"No current attributed judgment","judgment":null},{"id":"item-d1dc42f1ade325678531","text":"Unit and functional JaCoCo reports for the candidate are committed under `docs/qa/coverage/01-create-redirect/unit/` and `docs/qa/coverage/01-create-redirect/functional/`.","index":3,"source":{"file":"SPEC.md","line":376},"revision":"2b1e15aa7533ae83d35485b88b8a7373abd9b07c89c038aa441a55915c9088fb","state":"pending","reason":"No current attributed judgment","judgment":null},{"id":"item-dca3eb7441c151a7e2e2","text":"`docs/qa/TRACEABILITY.md` holds a table for `01-create-redirect` mapping AC-1 through AC-28 and business rules 1 to 12 to the tests that prove them, with the `FR`/`NFR` id beside each AC.","index":4,"source":{"file":"SPEC.md","line":377},"revision":"c1c2f7cebad12744808b47400398142c9b548ccf57ae97467735de9e01adc1f9","state":"pending","reason":"No current attributed judgment","judgment":null},{"id":"item-6bd4d94d72a049e8362f","text":"`docs/qa/GAPS.md` holds a row for `01-create-redirect`, either \"None for this slice\" or an honest gap with its compensating check.","index":5,"source":{"file":"SPEC.md","line":378},"revision":"41edaa828275405b38288cfac7abb1ed63ff472f8a9739724ec455e9f50bfc25","state":"pending","reason":"No current attributed judgment","judgment":null},{"id":"item-bffd5eb5f800ce09a317","text":"The first commit on `slice/01-create-redirect` contains only the dependency overrides (Tomcat embed 11.0.25, Jackson 3.1.7, Jackson 2 constraint 2.21.7); `scripts/gw check` is green on that commit alone; the builder's fresh OSV run for it is captured under `proof/` (mission plan-lock `qitem-20261003042553-03ac8b4b`).","index":6,"source":{"file":"SPEC.md","line":379},"revision":"f93b06ba5a6a655c43615768d90b97b78e0e22583668c45631a77e2803d53997","state":"pending","reason":"No current attributed judgment","judgment":null},{"id":"item-a8e8aee14d23dca9a30e","text":"`proof/` holds a captured exchange from the running service covering create (`201`), read (`200`), redirect (`302`), retire (`204`), the Visitor's `410` and one `400`, each with status line, response headers (`X-Request-Id`, `Location`, `Cache-Control` where applicable) and body: AC-1, AC-4, AC-8, AC-10, AC-12, AC-13 by effect.","index":7,"source":{"file":"SPEC.md","line":380},"revision":"337d2c4ec37600ae9e8d94ef31bb23a3ef5877568bfb7caaea434223cfd5aa2a","state":"pending","reason":"No current attributed judgment","judgment":null},{"id":"item-b869a712259c4fb482ed","text":"`proof/` holds the JSON log lines produced for those captured requests, showing `requestId` equal to each captured header and containing no URL, user agent, key or client address: AC-26 and AC-27 by effect.","index":8,"source":{"file":"SPEC.md","line":381},"revision":"7a81d7b58773a01bef5ad9da1943c1ef6baf1a23a8942703c8d24956eb80db84","state":"pending","reason":"No current attributed judgment","judgment":null},{"id":"item-82e0ac3c92328906f4fe","text":"`proof/` holds the audit rows written for the captured create and retire (a query result or export), showing actor, action, entity, before/after, request id and time: AC-22 and AC-23 by effect.","index":9,"source":{"file":"SPEC.md","line":382},"revision":"bf3864439e97118e0c136ffdd9ece6b43a0a7ce845e63e7201b062f3916d83bc","state":"pending","reason":"No current attributed judgment","judgment":null},{"id":"item-5f2ab4e8c0c86bcd6253","text":"`docs/api/openapi.json` is committed, generated deterministically with sorted keys, carries the examples AC-28 requires, and QA's diff of it against the candidate's live `/v3/api-docs` (both key-sorted) is empty (NFR-M3; mission shaping rule 5).","index":10,"source":{"file":"SPEC.md","line":383},"revision":"ca88af6156445a5e8c1dd3aa2f20be51ac474345f67e14addc6652e97fcea1cb","state":"pending","reason":"No current attributed judgment","judgment":null},{"id":"item-9bac2e16e0a7e029584a","text":"The ADRs listed under *Non-functional* exist and are indexed in `docs/DESIGN.md` §7 before the commits that depend on them (NFR-M2).","index":11,"source":{"file":"SPEC.md","line":384},"revision":"ea4d290dac5e2150701997a48f22a5bc5737f3c38dd0b72a323368577caf253f","state":"pending","reason":"No current attributed judgment","judgment":null},{"id":"item-020e091db631493f0aaf","text":"AC-19 is proven with suite-controlled time; the test and its clock control are named in the traceability row.","index":12,"source":{"file":"SPEC.md","line":385},"revision":"6f7959b67ac58b06f36ac4a1d39febb5389094fc031e55c610b020252297a115","state":"pending","reason":"No current attributed judgment","judgment":null},{"id":"item-6622351d3c963d9b9f0e","text":"The code review records that no application code path updates or deletes an audit row, and a persistence-level test in the unit suite asserts it (NFR-A2).","index":13,"source":{"file":"SPEC.md","line":386},"revision":"4759b741f01641445cb89956354df7707f6a32bf844b81a5012b4194a97d65b8","state":"pending","reason":"No current attributed judgment","judgment":null},{"id":"item-2d45a317f30cb6438584","text":"The code review and the release-prep secret scan record no secret in the repository and the public base URL as an environment-overridable setting with the shipped default (NFR-S4).","index":14,"source":{"file":"SPEC.md","line":387},"revision":"1b90f6e3b81234f3292feef33bac6b62074fcf0d46754e63d41836c8fb31dcd6","state":"pending","reason":"No current attributed judgment","judgment":null}],"issues":[],"policy":{"judges":["qa-agent@urlshort-factory"],"source":"/Users/andrzej/Documents/projekty/test/openrig/url-shortener/project.yaml","revision":"6a0dd52c6ca838a0aac94a8bfe73cf5ff494b473b7a4e832ef0b1f4cf9cb1d1f"},"attention":{"scope":"/Users/andrzej/Documents/projekty/test/openrig/url-shortener/missions/01-greenfield-core/slices/01-create-redirect","revision":"228a30ec7752ed1baecb522e9d2f99a6b71cc78211e7c192d6bd99cc3bd82d6d"}},"dependsOn":[],"eligible":true},{"scope":"02-analytics","id":"02-analytics","readiness":{"configured":true,"revision":"3d4d4c456e7babf90b816f8448cb3d6d68168b6335504e6263bcef062d3159f2","state":"unknown","history":[],"items":[],"issues":["No authored proof contract"],"policy":{"judges":["qa-agent@urlshort-factory"],"source":"/Users/andrzej/Documents/projekty/test/openrig/url-shortener/project.yaml","revision":"6a0dd52c6ca838a0aac94a8bfe73cf5ff494b473b7a4e832ef0b1f4cf9cb1d1f"},"attention":{"scope":"/Users/andrzej/Documents/projekty/test/openrig/url-shortener/missions/01-greenfield-core/slices/02-analytics","revision":"3d4d4c456e7babf90b816f8448cb3d6d68168b6335504e6263bcef062d3159f2"}},"dependsOn":["01-create-redirect"],"eligible":null},{"scope":"03-operate","id":"03-operate","readiness":{"configured":true,"revision":"3d4d4c456e7babf90b816f8448cb3d6d68168b6335504e6263bcef062d3159f2","state":"unknown","history":[],"items":[],"issues":["No authored proof contract"],"policy":{"judges":["qa-agent@urlshort-factory"],"source":"/Users/andrze